各位：\n本人因在实验中不幸触发<style=\"highlight\">高阶以太分解反应</style>，身体已遭到严重的虚空侵蚀。根据魔法安全条例第7章第3条，为防止虚空扩大波及他人，请在我去世后务必使用<style=\"highlight\">三层特制封印棺椁</style>将我收殓。\n切记：严禁任何形式的开棺和净化仪式，否则后果自负！\n关于我工位上的私人物品，请务必保持原状，交由我的亲属保管处理。\n最后，若念及旧情，请带一瓶金琥珀葡萄酒及巴克千层蛋糕置于我的墓前，好让这些能……安抚我躁动的亡魂。\n愿艾雅宽恕。\n<align=\"right\"><style=\"stress\">——让内·克拉夫特</style>","textdes_id":"573","document_page_count":"1","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"1","document_object_id":"0","document_item_id":"0","document_icon":"UI/Icon/Item/item_quest_mapstory_item4.png","document_image_icon":"UI/Icon/Item/item_quest_mapstory_item4.png","document_base_image":"UI/Prefabs/StoryReadItem/items/pbui_map_story_detail_item4.prefab","document_pic":"","document_gender":"false"},"say:2:1711149402:0":{"key":"say:2:1711149402:0","kind":"say","source_node_id":"2","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1711149402","action_index":"0","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"你将遗嘱上的内容转达给了宫廷魔法师们，他们也各自发现了疑点。","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:4:1711149403:1":{"key":"say:4:1711149403:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"4","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1711149403","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"这遗嘱在逻辑和时态上有些说不通……","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:5:1711149404:1":{"key":"say:5:1711149404:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"5","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1711149404","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"高阶以太分解反应是非常剧烈的，中咒者几秒钟内就会失去行...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"